  "bodyHash": "4022b40e9b7ff7c8",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\">搭配 Catalogue 模組使用，體驗更優化的模組選單！</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GyaLzXQ.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"323\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/ynenmrep\" alt=\"需要家具模組\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://mrcrayfish.com/img/website.svg\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的網站\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://mrcrayfish.com/img/youtube.svg\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 YouTube 頻道\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 Discord 伺服器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/MrCrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/MrCrayfish?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&logoColor=902121&message=Twitter\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 Twitter\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HO2ZqWk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"35\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MrCrayfish 更多家具模組是原版家具模組的擴充套件，旨在為熱門模組中的自訂木材類型提供支援。每種木材都會新增桌子、椅子、茶几、儲物櫃、床頭櫃、書桌、書桌櫃、百葉窗、升級版柵欄、升級版閘門、板條箱、公園長椅、郵箱、廚房檯面、廚房抽屜與廚房水槽等家具的新變體。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>為什麼這是擴充套件而不是主模組的一部分？</strong> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>這純粹是因為該模組的規模所致。它聽起來可能只是一個簡單的擴充套件，但背後其實包含數以千計的程式碼行與 JSON 檔案，對於單一開發者來說難以管理。若將此類內容加入基礎模組，不僅會拖慢開發進度，也會讓原本內容已十分豐富的模組更加臃腫。</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>✅ 支援的模組：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abundance\" rel=\"nofollow\">豐饒（Abundance）</a> by Team Aurora</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">大氣環境（Atmospheric）</a> by TeamAbnormals</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">秋意盎然（Autumnity）</a> by TeamAbnormals</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bayou-blues\" rel=\"nofollow\">沼地藍調（Bayou Blues）</a> by Team Aurora</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物羣系豐富（Biomes O Plenty）</a> by Forstride</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\">終界能量擴充（The Endergetic Expansion）</a> by TeamAbnormals</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">環境生態（Environmental）</a> by TeamAbnormals</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇妙生物羣系（Oh The Biomes You'll Go）</a> by AOCAWOL</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgrade-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">水生升級（Upgrade Aquatic）</a> by TeamAbnormals</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><strong>注意： </strong>預設情況下，本模組不會新增任何內容，除非同時安裝了上述至少一個模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>警告：若載入所有支援的模組，本模組將為遊戲新增 1,836 個新方塊。這可能會導致遊戲記憶體達上限，您或許需要為遊戲分配更多記憶體。若將此模組加入整合包，請務必留意此事。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HO2ZqWk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"35\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LmVCiaQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HO2ZqWk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"35\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">加入 MrCrayfish 的 Discord 社群，獲取模組安裝與設定協助、更新通知、開發截圖及更多資訊！</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z4ZuT0V.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"144\"></a></span></p>",
